    "attrs": {
      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span><span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip bad\">Hard</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Backtracking</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Trie</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/word-search-ii/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 212</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Word Search II</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Do not search the board once per word; search it once for all words. Put the words in a trie and let one backtracking DFS walk the board and the trie side by side: a letter with no trie child ends the path at once, a node holding a word reports it, and a trie branch whose words are all found is deleted so it is never walked again. O(m·n·4·3<sup>L-1</sup>) worst case, O(total letters) memory.</p>\n"
  },
